WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:06.292
Select Cite on the item. Citation review opens with the charge priced from the schedule.

2
00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:17.875
The owner is a company, so the citation needs a registered agent. Open Recipients and enter the agent.

3
00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:20.524
Choose Done to return to the citation.

4
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:26.543
Select the items that share a deadline, enter the date and apply it.

5
00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:33.263
Choose Issue. Every check has passed; confirm the mailed date and choose Issue citation.

6
00:00:33.263 --> 00:00:37.614
After the shared save, Workspace opens with the issued case highlighted.
